          "title": "How Was Your Weekend?",
          "description": "Cuenta lo que hiciste con was/were y el past simple.",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "lesson_id": "last_weekend_lesson",
              "title": "was / were and the past simple",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "How was your weekend?",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Morning, Lucía! How was your weekend?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "It was great, thanks. On Saturday I went to the market with Priya."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "The market by the harbour? What did you buy?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I bought some cheese and some flowers. Then we cooked a big lunch."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Lovely. And on Sunday?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "On Sunday I visited the Clifton Suspension Bridge. It was beautiful, but it was very windy!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Were you there alone?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "No, I wasn't. Sam was with me. We walked for three hours. And you? What did you do?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "I watched the rugby with my friends, and I phoned my mam in Galway. She asked about you!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "About me?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Daniel",
                        "text": "Well… I talked about my new colleague from Spain. That's all!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "Monday morning. Lucía is at the office. It's her third week in Bristol, and her English is better every day."
                  }
                },
